character.kweebec-child.epithet=Curious child
character.kweebec-farmer.epithet=Farmer
character.kweebec-mage.epithet=Mage
character.kweebec-villager.name=Kweebec
dialogue.kweebec-child.text=Do you think beetles dream? I asked one, it did not answer.
dialogue.kweebec-child.bye=Maybe they do.
dialogue.kweebec-farmer.text=The soil is generous this season. Mind the seedlings on your way through.
dialogue.kweebec-farmer.bye=I will.
dialogue.kweebec-mage.text=The roots hum tonight. Something old stirs beneath the forest.
dialogue.kweebec-mage.bye=I will keep my ears open.
names.kweebec-names.name.bramble=Bramble
names.kweebec-names.name.fern=Fern
names.kweebec-names.name.moss=Moss
names.kweebec-names.name.sorrel=Sorrel
quest.kweebec-farewell.title=Mind the seedlings
quest.kweebec-farewell.description=The farmer worries about the seedlings. Promise to be careful on your way through.
quest.kweebec-farewell.short=Promise the farmer to mind the seedlings
quest.kweebec-fibres.title=Fibres for the farmer
quest.kweebec-fibres.description=The farmer needs plant fiber and sticks to tie up the seedlings. Bring them, all at once or a bit at a time.
quest.kweebec-fibres.short=Bring 10 plant fibers and 5 sticks to the farmer
quest.kweebec-mage.title=The only mage
quest.kweebec-mage.description=There is only one Kweebec mage in all the lands, and the roots speak through them. Seek them out before it is too late.
quest.kweebec-mage.short=Talk to the Kweebec mage
quest.kweebec-talk.title=A word with the farmer
quest.kweebec-talk.description=The Kweebec village has a farmer who knows every seedling by name. Go and say hello.
quest.kweebec-talk.short=Talk to the village farmer
